README for gmusicbrowser

REQUIREMENTS

    The following additional features may be enabled by installing the listed
    optional dependencies:

        * Support GStreamer for playback:
            p5-gstreamer, perl-glib-object-introspection

        * Support tray icon:
            p5-gtk2-trayicon

        * Support desktop notifications
            p5-gtk2-notify

        * Gstreamer1 playback output
            p5-glib-object-introspection
            p5-gstreamer1

        * mplayer playback output
            mplayer

        * mpv playback output
            mpv

        * mpg123, ogg123, ... playback output
            mpg123
            ogg123
            ...

